     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A factorial for any positive whole number <i>n</i> (denoted <i>n</i>!) is the product of every whole number less than or equal to <i>n</i>. We define 0! to be equal to one.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{10!}}{{7!3!}} = \\frac{{10 \\times 9 \\times 8 \\times \\cancel{{7!}}}}{{\\cancel{{7!}} \\times 3 \\times 2 \\times 1}} = \\frac{{720}}{6} = 120\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "120"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
